        "Presence of chronic kidney disease or other metabolic disorders",
        "Abnormal serum calcium and phosphate levels inconsistent with familial form"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "calcinosis-cutis",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Localized calcium deposits often associated with connective tissue diseases",
        "Lack of familial inheritance and hyperphosphatemia"
      ]
    }
  ],
